WEBVTT

00:00:10.066 --> 00:00:11.151
Oh!

00:00:11.584 --> 00:00:13.387
-GRU: Dave...
-(WHISTLES)
戴夫

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.655
Earth to Dave!
地面呼叫戴夫

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:16.993
Huh?

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:18.492
You can leave now.
你现在可以走了

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:19.659
Oh, uh... (CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)
你现在可以走了

00:00:27.332 --> 00:00:29.461
GRU: So, what do we got?
Who's on the list?
嫌疑人有哪些？

00:00:29.909 --> 00:00:31.089
Fire them at me.
全部告诉我

00:00:31.212 --> 00:00:33.772
First suspect, Hedda Blumentoft,
嫌疑人一号

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:35.842
proprietor of Mum's the Word Floral Shop.
她也是“老妈大过天”花店的老板

00:00:36.356 --> 00:00:37.802
No, not her.
不 不是她

00:00:38.186 --> 00:00:39.603
Okay, moving on...
好的 继续

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:42.432
Chuck Kinney, owner of Stuff-A-Bear.
恰德肯尼 “塞塞熊”的老板

00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:45.644
Ooh.

00:00:45.902 --> 00:00:46.978
-(WAILING)
-I don't think so.
我觉得不是

00:00:47.812 --> 00:00:48.939
EDUARDO: Hello?
有人吗？

00:00:52.388 --> 00:00:54.519
Buenos días, my friends!
早上好 我的朋友们

00:00:55.248 --> 00:00:57.531
I am Eduardo Perez,
爱德华多裴瑞兹

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:00.709
owner of Salsa y Salsa restaurant,
across the mall.
莎莎餐厅的老板

00:01:01.202 --> 00:01:03.912
Now open for breakfast. And you are?
现在供应早餐

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.835
Gru. And this is Lucy. And we are closed.
格鲁 这位是露西

00:01:07.218 --> 00:01:09.215
This is just going to take un momento.
只要一会会儿就好

00:01:09.454 --> 00:01:11.836
I am throwing a big Cinco de Mayo party,
我要开一个盛大的五月五节日派对

00:01:12.165 --> 00:01:15.730
and I am going to need
200 of your best cupcakes
要买200个

00:01:16.264 --> 00:01:19.928
decorated with the Mexican flag.
蛋糕上装饰

00:01:20.143 --> 00:01:21.680
It looks something like this.
国旗是这个样子的

00:01:21.725 --> 00:01:22.847
(GRUNTS)
国旗是这个样子的

00:01:23.573 --> 00:01:24.683
What do you think?
意下如何？

00:01:24.808 --> 00:01:26.308
LUCY: (GASPS) Ooh.
GRU: Oh.

00:01:26.951 --> 00:01:28.812
-Look away!
- You, whoo. (CHUCKLES)

00:01:28.895 --> 00:01:30.021
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:01:30.346 --> 00:01:33.984
Anyway, I have to go. It's all settled.
I'll pick them up next week!
好了 我得走了 就这么定了

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:37.946
Have a good day.
Come by if you get a chance, okay?
有空过来串门吧

00:01:39.055 --> 00:01:40.306
(GROANS)

00:01:41.611 --> 00:01:44.701
And welcome to the mall family.
欢迎来到 商场大家庭

00:01:45.787 --> 00:01:46.830
(GASPS)

00:01:52.729 --> 00:01:53.962
(WHISPERING) El Macho.
猛爷

00:01:54.556 --> 00:01:56.201
What?
But it couldn't be.
不可能

00:01:56.756 --> 00:01:57.884
What? What couldn't be?
什么不可能？

00:01:59.716 --> 00:02:04.539
That guy looks exactly like
a villain named El Macho.
那家伙和20年前的一个恶人

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:06.808
From about 20 years ago.
长得一模一样

00:02:13.067 --> 00:02:14.232
He was ruthless!
他心狠手辣

00:02:14.791 --> 00:02:15.900
He was dangerous.
是个危险人物

00:02:16.174 --> 00:02:20.071
And as the name implies, very macho.
人如其名

00:02:30.345 --> 00:02:35.170
He had a reputation for pulling off
heists using only his bare hands!
他以赤手空拳去抢劫

00:02:37.515 --> 00:02:42.414
But sadly, like all the greats,
El Macho was gone too soon.
死得太早

00:02:43.337 --> 00:02:45.805
He died in the most macho way possible.
他选择了世间最猛的死法

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.599
Riding a shark
骑着一条鲨鱼

00:02:47.964 --> 00:02:51.936
with 250 pounds of dynamite
strapped to his chest
胸口绑着226斤炸药

00:02:52.435 --> 00:02:55.982
into the mouth of an active volcano!
跳进了一座活火山的喷出口

00:02:58.993 --> 00:03:00.241
It was glorious.
场面相当壮观

00:03:02.203 --> 00:03:05.450
Yeah, sounds like El Macho's pretty dead.
猛爷不是已经死了吗？

00:03:05.745 --> 00:03:07.952
They never found the body. Oh, no.
没人找到他的尸体

00:03:08.306 --> 00:03:13.159
All that was ever retrieved
was a pile of singed chest hair.
能找到的只有

00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:17.128
But that face! It has got to be El Macho!
他一定是猛爷

00:03:17.587 --> 00:03:21.424
(GASPS) Then what do you say you and
I break into his restaurant? Tonight?
我们俩夜闯他的餐厅怎么样？

00:03:21.813 --> 00:03:24.277
Yes, that's good,because I am telling you,
我告诉你

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:28.306
if anybody in this place
has the PX-41 serum,
如果PX-41血清真的在这里

00:03:29.719 --> 00:03:30.892
it's him.
那就一定在他手上

00:03:31.101 --> 00:03:32.560
(LAUGHING)

00:03:33.689 --> 00:03:37.428
All right, all right, homework done,
pajamas on, teeth brushed, time for bed.
好了 好了 作业做完了
睡衣穿上了

00:03:37.471 --> 00:03:38.643
What's the big hurry?
怎么那么急？

00:03:38.681 --> 00:03:40.596
I just have a lot of work to do.
我有很多工作要做

00:03:40.663 --> 00:03:42.320
Work, what kind of work?
工作？什么样的工作？

00:03:42.524 --> 00:03:44.030
Very important business.
很重要的生意

00:03:44.384 --> 00:03:46.465
-So, hugs, kisses. (KISSES)
-(GIGGLING)
抱抱 亲亲

00:03:46.669 --> 00:03:48.910
Good night, sleep tight,
don't let the bedbugs
晚安 做个好梦 别让臭虫

00:03:48.993 --> 00:03:49.994
blah-blah-blah.Whoa!
吧啦吧啦吧啦

00:03:50.328 --> 00:03:53.748
But you said you'd help me practice
my part for the Mother's Day show.
练习母亲节那天的表演

00:03:53.915 --> 00:03:55.166
(SIGHS)
练习母亲节那天的表演

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:58.166
Fine, fine. Let me hear it. Quickly.
我来听听看 抓紧时间

00:03:59.275 --> 00:04:02.513
She kisses my boo-boos,
she braids my hair
她亲吻我的伤口

00:04:02.944 --> 00:04:05.301
My mother is beyond compare
我的妈妈无人能比

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:08.126
We love you, mothers, everywhere
我们爱你 亲爱的妈妈

00:04:09.395 --> 00:04:11.930
Wow! That was something else.
真是 让人眼前一亮

00:04:12.248 --> 00:04:15.078
I really liked the way you smiled at
the end.
我很喜欢你最后的那个微笑

00:04:15.476 --> 00:04:17.063
Let's try this one more time,
我们再来一次

00:04:17.247 --> 00:04:22.235
but a teensy bit less like a zombie,
okay?
稍微别那么像僵尸

00:04:22.639 --> 00:04:23.653
-Okay.
好的

00:04:23.678 --> 00:04:26.863
She kisses my boo-boos, she braids
my hair...
她亲吻我的伤口

00:04:26.878 --> 00:04:28.408
Perfect! Time to go.
完美 我该走了

00:04:28.783 --> 00:04:30.274
I don't think I should do this.
我觉得我不该去表演

00:04:31.587 --> 00:04:33.135
Well, what do you mean? Why not?
什么意思？为什么不去？

00:04:33.708 --> 00:04:35.035
I don't even have a mom.
我根本就没有妈妈

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:38.793
Well, you don't need one to do the show.
不一定要有妈妈

00:04:39.057 --> 00:04:41.726
I mean, you did the Veterans Day Pageant
你参加了退伍军人节的游行

00:04:41.889 --> 00:04:43.467
and you haven't been in combat.
但你并没上过战场

00:04:44.642 --> 00:04:45.675
This is different.
不一样的

00:04:46.442 --> 00:04:50.895
Okay, well, then maybe
you can just use your imagination.
好吧 那你可以用你的想象力

00:04:51.484 --> 00:04:53.767
You mean I pretend I have a mom?
你是说 我假装有个妈妈吗？

00:04:54.073 --> 00:04:56.644
Yes, right? You can do that, can't you?
对吧？你能做到吧？

00:04:57.018 --> 00:04:58.797
Yeah! I do that all the time.
能 我一直都是这么做的

00:04:59.362 --> 00:05:00.391
Thanks, Gru!
谢谢你 格鲁

00:05:03.763 --> 00:05:06.196
Hey!
(SINGING JOYFULLY IN MINIONESE)

